- **PASSWORD_VERIFICATION**: Transfer password verification;  
- **PENDING**: Transfer-in in progress;  
- **SUCCESS**: Transfer-in succeeded;  
- **FAIL**: Transfer-in failed.', example='SUCCESS'),
  status?: int32(name='Status', description='Detailed domain name transfer-in status. Valid values:  
